1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,060
Look carefully with your heart.

2
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:36,060
The truth is right around the corner.

3
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:39,060
Hey you, good or bad—truth or lies?

4
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:42,000
Can't escape the gray smoke of this heart.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Bring all your courage.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Maybe we can save the world.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

8
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Mojo Spy

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,040
Happy Birthday

12
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:14,640
Wen Kang

13
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,920
Why are you asking about him?

14
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:20,640
We suspect he's connected to Miss MU's coma.

15
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:25,319
Why should I tell you?

16
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:27,379
You rascal.

17
00:01:27,379 --> 00:01:29,719
Don't you care at all whether Miss MU lives or dies?

18
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:34,879
An artist like Miss MU.

19
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:35,920
As long as I want to boost them.

20
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:38,260
Tomorrow, there'll be plenty of replacements.

21
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:39,379
Idol

22
00:01:39,379 --> 00:01:42,659
Puberty itself is very short.

23
00:01:42,659 --> 00:01:46,259
Why should I worry about a washed-up entertainer like that?

24
00:01:53,259 --> 00:01:54,900
Agent Long

25
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:57,299
What shady business has your company been up to?

26
00:01:57,299 --> 00:02:00,780
Our police station keeps records without missing a single clue.

27
00:02:00,780 --> 00:02:04,599
It's just that we've been busy lately.

28
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:07,140
So we couldn't find time to visit you.

29
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:11,300
This time, we hope you'll cooperate nicely with us.

30
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:18,780
Uh, well, Wen Kang is a freelance dancer.

31
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:21,099
But ever since Miss MU debuted,

32
00:02:21,099 --> 00:02:22,860
He's been her backup dancer.

33
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:25,680
I can't really say why.

34
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,680
Maybe that silly boy has a crush on Miss MU.

35
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:31,000
Then who is Xiaolu?

36
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,219
Xiaolu?

37
00:02:32,219 --> 00:02:38,260
Isn't that the girl who participated in the star selection contest with Miss MU back then?

38
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:41,580
But she forfeited during the final round.

39
00:02:41,580 --> 00:02:43,100
What a pity.

40
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:43,980
Originally,

41
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:46,740
She could have been trained into a profitable artist.

42
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:49,420
So what's the relationship between Wen Kang and Xiaolu?

43
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:51,819
I only heard that Wen Kang has a younger sister.

44
00:02:51,819 --> 00:02:53,340
Seems she was traumatized earlier.

45
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:57,259
Could his sister be Xiaolu?

46
00:02:57,259 --> 00:02:59,200
One last question.

47
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:02,000
Around the time Miss MU collapsed on stage,

48
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:05,560
Did Wen Kang do anything unusual?

49
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:11,280
I remember now.

50
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:14,460
That day, before I urged Miss MU to go on stage,

51
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:16,439
Wen Kang gave her a glass of juice

52
00:03:16,439 --> 00:03:22,740
Then after that, he just kept going to the hospital to stare blankly at Miss MU

53
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:23,740
How could you do this?

54
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:26,740
Wait a minute

55
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:28,740
Could it be that Wen Kang poisoned her

56
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:31,740
Thank you for assisting with the investigation

57
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:42,740
Miss MU

58
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:43,740
I'm sorry

59
00:03:45,740 --> 00:03:47,740
I'm the one who harmed you

60
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:52,820
I'm begging you

61
00:03:52,820 --> 00:03:55,200
Please wake up

62
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,280
Please wake up

63
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,760
You've already started suspecting me

64
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:11,900
Yes

65
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:15,020
Actually, you're right to be suspicious

66
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:17,579
I did it

67
00:04:17,579 --> 00:04:19,800
She took everything from my sister

68
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:22,339
And I took everything from her

69
00:04:22,339 --> 00:04:25,599
I'm a beast trapped in the abyss of revenge

70
00:04:25,599 --> 00:04:27,599
I deserve punishment

71
00:04:27,599 --> 00:04:29,919
Arrest me

72
00:04:29,919 --> 00:04:31,439
Our mission

73
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:33,759
isn't just to arrest those who've done wrong

74
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:37,379
If you can't truly forgive each other

75
00:04:37,379 --> 00:04:40,039
this cycle of hatred will just keep repeating

76
00:04:40,039 --> 00:04:45,019
Miss MU is in this state because of me

77
00:04:45,019 --> 00:04:48,120
How could she ever forgive me so easily?

78
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:52,039
She can only sleep forever, never waking up

79
00:04:52,039 --> 00:04:54,120
And I will blame myself forever

80
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:57,079
She will never forgive me

81
00:04:57,079 --> 00:04:58,719
Never forgive me

82
00:04:58,719 --> 00:05:03,859
Miss MU has already forgiven you

83
00:05:03,859 --> 00:05:10,319
Miss MU told me she regrets it

84
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:12,919
If I could do it over again,

85
00:05:12,919 --> 00:05:13,659
She would certainly

86
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,460
If I could do it over again,

87
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:18,280
I would cherish my friendship with Xiaolu

88
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:22,760
I am a guilty person

89
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:26,640
But you still care for me and are so thoughtful

90
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:29,180
Wen Kang, no matter what,

91
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:31,840
I will not blame you

92
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:38,020
Miss MU, you really forgive me?

93
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:39,460
Really?

94
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:41,900
Xiaolu often mentions you

95
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:43,480
He even said he wants to sing with you

96
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:49,759
Since the misunderstanding has been resolved,

97
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,259
Please bring out the antidote

98
00:05:51,259 --> 00:05:52,720
and let her wake up

99
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,720
Actually,

100
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,379
the one behind the scenes who instructed me

101
00:05:57,379 --> 00:05:59,160
A terrible young boy.

102
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:01,420
He keeps saying

103
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:03,680
he loves all things beautiful.

104
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,460
But to get

105
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,620
Sleeping Beauty's voice,

106
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:06,960
he forced me to poison

107
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,480
and steal Miss MU's voice.

108
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:11,920
Hmm, in that case,

109
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:15,840
he'll definitely make his move next.

110
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:18,980
Looks like we should prepare to welcome our guest.

111
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:19,759
Right?

112
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:47,100
You are indeed Sleeping Beauty.

113
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:51,740
From now on, your haunting voice

114
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:54,480
belongs only to The Illumin-Eye.

115
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:58,240
We will make your voice eternal.

116
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:19,759
Hmph, what lovely colors.

117
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:32,000
Who are you?

118
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,319
Hmph.

119
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:42,079
You must be the ones Mr.K mentioned,

120
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:44,399
who are hindering The Illumin-Eye's revival plan.

121
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:51,860
This time I underestimated my opponent.

122
00:07:51,860 --> 00:07:55,639
But next time, I'll make you truly appreciate my art.

123
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:57,539
Don't run!

124
00:08:01,939 --> 00:08:03,539
This is ten stories high!

125
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:04,540
Xiaolu.

126
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:06,540
Is he out of his mind?

127
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:29,540
Xiaolu

128
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:32,539
Don't you want to sing with Miss MU?

129
00:08:33,539 --> 00:08:34,539
Why don't you sing for her now?

130
00:08:39,539 --> 00:08:45,539
Happy birthday to you

131
00:08:45,539 --> 00:08:53,539
Happy birthday to you

132
00:08:53,539 --> 00:08:59,539
Happy birthday to you

133
00:09:03,539 --> 00:09:13,279
Xiaolu

134
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,519
I'm sorry

135
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:17,019
Will you forgive me?

136
00:09:17,019 --> 00:09:18,899
Silly

137
00:09:18,899 --> 00:09:21,699
You've become as slow as a clover

138
00:09:21,699 --> 00:09:23,860
I already forgave you

139
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:28,659
Let's eat cake!

140
00:09:28,659 --> 00:09:31,219
Is there really someone's birthday today?

141
00:09:31,219 --> 00:09:32,740
I don't know that

142
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:35,740
But in this world, there's always someone having a birthday today

143
00:09:35,740 --> 00:09:37,740
Even though we don't know them

144
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,740
We can still wish them happy birthday

145
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:42,740
You fool

146
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:44,740
Glutton, you even learned to make excuses

147
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:32,720
【Ending Theme】

148
00:10:32,740 --> 00:10:35,980
The world dreams of more

149
00:10:35,980 --> 00:10:38,460
Looking forward to life

150
00:10:38,460 --> 00:10:42,259
Every second, every moment

151
00:10:42,259 --> 00:10:47,620
Oh, bright eyes twinkling

152
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:51,419
With a smile facing the sun

153
00:10:51,419 --> 00:10:53,340
Crashing through the bushes

154
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:57,060
At the blinking crossroads